{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:4dd5afd38d7e95e6","name":"Shield Generator","source":{"id":"source:reference-4dd5afd38d7e95e6","title":"Shield Generator","revision":19766,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:34:23Z","sha256":"e867f265925a7c9ff064476a2776c7d6c5c4b99cf3aeecf65b18801d3146af64","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19766","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Shield%20Generator&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-4dd5afd38d7e95e6","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["SHIELD RATING"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/SHIELD_RATING"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["COST\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["UPGRADE POINT"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/UPGRADE_POINT"}," COST\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["AVAILABILITY\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["SR 5\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["5,000\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["2\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Restricted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restricted"},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["SR 10\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["10,000\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["3\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["A deflector Shield Generator can be built into a suit of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Medium Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Medium_Armor","referenceId":"reference:e2a45d7d144d40dd"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Armor","referenceId":"reference:4bc2d20a5687b54f"},", giving it the same kind of protection ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships"}," and some Battle Droids enjoy. Due to their bulk and power requirements, it is not possible to install anything but the smallest of Shield Generators into a suit of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"},"; in fact, only ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Armor","referenceId":"reference:4bc2d20a5687b54f"}," of at least Medium size can carry a SR 10 Shield Generator.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Shield Generators operate for 10 rounds on a standard ",{"tag":"a","children":["Energy Cell"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Energy_Cell","referenceId":"reference:a3dedb9c17e4ee9d"},". (Suits of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," with Shield Generators commonly have the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Internal Generator"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Internal_Generator","referenceId":"reference:24bf81f33f973d09"}," Upgrade.) Turning a Shield Generator on or off is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},". When active, reduce the damage you take by the Armor's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"},". If the damage is equal to or greater than the Armor's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"},", the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"}," is reduced by 5 points. By spending three ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Actions"}," on the same or consecutive rounds, the wearer can make a DC 20 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check to restore lost shield power. If the check succeeds, the Armor's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"}," increases by 5 points (up to its maximum ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"},").\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
